t-family:'Libre Baskerville',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(30px,3.8vw,46px);margin:12px 0 16px\">Tell us about your yard<\u002Fh2>\n    <p style=\"color:#55624F;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 22px\">We'll walk the property with you, sketch some ideas on the spot, and send a written estimate within 48 hours. No pressure, no obligation — and the coffee's on us.<\u002Fp>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;font-size:15px;color:#3B4A36;font-weight:600\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\"><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;background:#3F6B3A;-webkit-mask:url(&quot;2305346a-8a7f-4323-987f-3d328bd30ee0&quot;) center/contain no-repeat;mask:url(&quot;2305346a-8a7f-4323-987f-3d328bd30ee0&quot;) center/contain no-repeat\"><\u002Fspan>(704) 555-0126<\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\"><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;background:#3F6B3A;-webkit-mask:url(&quot;3949d665-e439-4b77-98d3-fa08acf15d62&quot;) center/contain no-repeat;mask:url(&quot;3949d665-e439-4b77-98d3-fa08acf15d62&quot;) center/contain no-repeat\"><\u002Fspan>hello@stonebrookoutdoor.com<\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\"><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;background:#3F6B3A;-webkit-mask:url(&quot;3662c84d-4592-4567-a311-874f2b494469&quot;) center/contain no-repeat;mask:url(&quot;3662c84d-4592-4567-a311-874f2b494469&quot;) center/contain no-repeat\"><\u002Fspan>Serving Charlotte, Matthews, Huntersville &amp; Ballantyne<\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n  <div data-reveal=\"\" style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DFD2;border-radius:20px;padding:30px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(34,48,31,.1)\">\n    <sc-if value=\"{{ formIdle }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n      <div style=\"display:grid;gap:12px\">\n        <input value=\"{{ fName }}\" onchange=\"{{ setName }}\" placeholder=\"Your name\" style=\"background:#F7F5EF;border:1px solid #E2DFD2;border-radius:10px;color:#22301F;padding:14px;font-size:15px;outline:none\">\n        <input value=\"{{ fPhone }}\" onchange=\"{{ setPhone }}\" placeholder=\"Phone or email\" style=\"background:#F7F5EF;border:1px solid #E2DFD2;border-radius:10px;color:#22301F;padding:14px;font-size:15px;outline:none\">\n        <select value=\"{{ fProject }}\" onchange=\"{{ setProject }}\" style=\"background:#F7F5EF;border:1px solid #E2DFD2;border-radius:10px;color:#22301F;padding:14px;font-size:15px;outline:none\">\n          <option value=\"\">What are you dreaming of?<\u002Foption>\n          <option>Patio or outdoor living space<\u002Foption>\n          <option>Full landscape redesign<\u002Foption>\n          <option>Lawn care &amp; maintenance<\u002Foption>\n          <option>Outdoor lighting<\u002Foption>\n          <option>Drainage or grading fix<\u002Foption>\n        <\u002Fselect>\n        <textarea value=\"{{ fNotes }}\" onchange=\"{{ setNotes }}\" placeholder=\"Tell us a little about the space...\" rows=\"3\" style=\"background:#F7F5EF;border:1px solid #E2DFD2;border-radius:10px;color:#22301F;padding:14px;font-size:15px;outline:none;resize:vertical\"><\u002Ftextarea>\n        <button onclick=\"{{ submitForm }}\" style=\"background:#3F6B3A;color:#F7F5EF;border:none;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-weight:800;font-size:16px;padding:15px;border-radius:999px\" style-hover=\"background:#2E5029\">Request My Free Estimate<\u002Fbutton>\n        <div style=\"color:#8A9483;font-size:12.5px;text-align:center\">Written estimate within 48 hours. We never share your info.<\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fsc-if>\n    <sc-if value=\"{{ formDone }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;padding:30px 8px;animation:slideIn .4s ease\">\n        <div style=\"width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:#EBF2DF;display:grid;place-items:center;margin:0 auto 16px\">\n          <span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;background:#3F6B3A;-webkit-mask:url(&quot;e63dccd7-8af1-4ec1-9ce3-482d182c92da&quot;) center/contain no-repeat;mask:url(&quot;e63dccd7-8af1-4ec1-9ce3-482d182c92da&quot;) center/contain no-repeat\"><\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"font-family:'Libre Baskerville',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:22px\">You're on the books!<\u002Fdiv>\n        <p style=\"color:#55624F;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:10px 0 20px\">Thanks {{ doneName }} — we'll reach out within one business day to schedule your walkthrough.<\u002Fp>\n        <button onclick=\"{{ resetForm }}\" style=\"background:transparent;border:1.5px solid #E2DFD2;color:#55624F;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:999px\" style-hover=\"border-color:#3F6B3A;color:#3F6B3A\">Start over<\u002Fbutton>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fsc-if>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<!-- Footer -->\n<footer style=\"background:#22301F;color:#AEBBA4;padding:44px 5vw;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:22px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n  <div style=\"font-family:'Libre Baskerville',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#F0EEE4\">Stonebrook <span style=\"color:#8DBF4C;font-style:italic;font-weight:400\">Outdoor<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n  <div style=\"font-size:14px\">Charlotte, NC · (704) 555-0126 · hello@stonebrookoutdoor.com<\u002Fdiv>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13.5px\">Licensed &amp; insured · NC Landscape Contractor #L-4482<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Ffooter>\n\n<\u002Fx-dc>\n<script type=\"text/x-dc\" data-dc-script=\"\">\nclass Component extends DCLogic {\n  state = { ba: 50, name: '', phone: '', project: '', notes: '', done: false };\n\n  componentDidMount() {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((es) => {\n      es.forEach(e => { if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('on'); io.unobserve(e.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.12 });\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]').forEach(el => io.observe(el));\n    this._io = io;\n    this._move = (e) => {\n      if (!this._dragging) return;\n      const wrap = document.querySelector('[data-ba-wrap]');\n      if (!wrap) return;\n      const rect = wrap.getBoundingClientRect();\n      const x = (e.touches ? e.touches[0].clientX : e.clientX) - rect.left;\n      this.setState({ ba: Math.max(4, Math.min(96, (x / rect.width) * 100)) });\n    };\n    this._up = () => { this._dragging = false; };\n    window.addEventListener('mousemove', this._move);\n    window.addEventListener('touchmove', this._move);\n    window.addEventListener('mouseup', this._up);\n    window.addEventListener('touchend', this._up);\n  }\n  componentWillUnmount() {\n    if (this._io) this._io.disconnect();\n    window.removeEventListener('mousemove', this._move);\n    window.removeEventListener('touchmove', this._move);\n    window.removeEventListener('mouseup', this._up);\n    window.removeEventListener('touchend', this._up);\n  }\n\n  renderVals() {\n    const ic = n => `https://unpkg.com/lucide-static@0.462.0/icons/${n}.svg`;\n    return {\n      baClip: this.state.ba + '%',\n      baInnerW: (10000 / this.state.ba) + '%',\n      baStart: (e) => { e.preventDefault(); this._dragging = true; },\n      formIdle: !this.state.done,\n      formDone: this.state.done,\n      doneName: this.state.name ? this.state.name.split(' ')[0] : 'neighbor',\n      fName: this.state.name, setName: e => this.setState({ name: e.target.value }),\n      fPhone: this.state.phone, setPhone: e => this.setState({ phone: e.target.value }),\n      fProject: this.state.project, setProject: e => this.setState({ project: e.target.value }),\n      fNotes: this.state.notes, setNotes: e => this.setState({ notes: e.target.value }),\n      submitForm: () => this.setState({ done: true }),\n      resetForm: () => this.setState({ done: false, name: '', phone: '', project: '', notes: '' }),\n      services: [\n        { icon: ic('pencil-ruler'), name: 'Landscape Design', desc: '3D renderings of your future yard before a single shovel hits the dirt.' },\n        { icon: ic('layers'), name: 'Patios & Hardscape', desc: 'Paver patios, walkways, retaining walls and fire pits built to outlast the house.' },\n        { icon: ic('flower-2'), name: 'Planting & Gardens', desc: 'Native, low-maintenance plantings chosen for Carolina clay and Carolina summers.' },\n        { icon: ic('lightbulb'), name: 'Outdoor Lighting', desc: 'Low-voltage landscape lighting that makes the evening the best part of the yard.' },\n        { icon: ic('scissors'), name: 'Lawn Care', desc: 'Weekly mowing, seasonal cleanups, aeration and overseeding — on autopilot.' },\n        { icon: ic('cloud-rain'), name: 'Drainage & Irrigation', desc: 'French drains, grading and smart sprinklers that end soggy-yard season for good.' },\n      ],\n      process: [\n        { n: '1', title: 'Walk & talk', desc: 'A free on-site walkthrough where we listen first and sketch ideas on the spot.' },\n        { n: '2', title: 'See the design', desc: 'A rendering and itemized estimate within 48 hours — adjust anything you like.' },\n        { n: '3', title: 'We build it', desc: 'One dedicated crew, a posted schedule, and a tidy site every single evening.' },\n        { n: '4', title: 'We keep it beautiful', desc: 'Optional care plans keep your investment thriving season after season.' },\n      ],\n      reviews: [\n        { name: 'Priya S.', area: 'Ballantyne', text: 'They turned a mud pit into the patio where we now spend every Friday night. On schedule, on budget, and the crew was wonderful with our dog.' },\n        { name: 'Mike & Dana R.', area: 'Matthews', text: 'The 3D design sold us instantly — and the finished yard looks BETTER than the rendering. Neighbors literally stop to ask who did it.' },\n        { name: 'Ellen W.', area: 'Huntersville', text: 'Three years on their maintenance plan. My yard has never looked this good and I have never touched the mower. Worth every cent.' },\n      ],\n    };\n  }\n}\n<\u002Fscript>\n\n\n<\u002Fbody><\u002Fhtml>"
